implementationPlan.description:
Verification, once, before moe.complete_task (DoD 4).

Under the jetbrains-gradle lease, run the checkRef from the worktree root. It is byte for byte /mnt/d/moe-scratch/7faede18-plan/verify.sh, and in order it runs:
- parity-check;
- lint;
- the DoD's `gradlew.bat test --rerun`, through cmd.exe in this worktree's moe-jetbrains (WSL has no JDK);
- the JUnit XML totals, failing on any failure or error.
Its fresh output is the complete_task evidence. Also list the new rows' skipped cases from build/test-results: the link and FIFO cases skip on this host, and CI's ubuntu `./gradlew test` runs them.

Release the lease on every path. Never run clean. Never pattern-kill a Gradle or Java process.
